{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112490","id":2986801342,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yBvi-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112490","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112490.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112490.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112490","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112490/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112490/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112490/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/aafac7d75c74d42a5645803a615a6f6659f90b71","number":112490,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `ShaderPreprocessor.consume_line_continuations()` skipping characters","user":{"login":"andyprice","id":133737,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzczNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice","html_url":"https://github.com/andyprice","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andyprice/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This function increments the code index by 2 when a line continuation is found, additional to the loop increment, so it skips over the next character following a line continuation.\r\n\r\nIn shader code like\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\n#define FUN_FUN(n)\\\r\nvoid fun1() { return;\\\r\n}\\\r\nvoid fun2() { return; }\r\nFUN_FUN(1.0)\r\n```\r\n\r\nthe first `}` will visibly get skipped, causing this error:\r\n\r\n```\r\n   10 | \r\nE  11->  void fun1() { return;void fun2() { return; } \r\n   12 |\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `v` in `void` will also get skipped over, but as the next `o` is enough to decide to end the loop, that is less obvious.\r\n\r\nSimplify consume_line_continuations() to remove the unnecessary offset parameter and the extra loop index variable, and increment index the right amount.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.